URL: https://github.com/pulsesmartlab-innovations/NextGenCrossDesign
BugReports: https://github.com/pulsesmartlab-innovations/NextGenCrossDesign/issues
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: To run analyses, a local R installation with the
    'nextgenCrossDesign' backend package installed and reachable via a
    configured 'Rscript' (set in the app's config.yml). The backend is
    distributed separately at
    <https://github.com/pulsesmartlab-innovations/nextgenCrossDesignR> and
    compiles native code, so it needs Rtools (Windows), the Xcode command line
    tools (macOS), or build-essential (Linux). The front-end can be installed
    and its user interface launched without the backend.
